    detailedEthos: "Ragnar embodies the raw, unbending warrior spirit of the Viking Age. While he is represented as a fierce fighter, he is also a brilliant strategist who uses psychological terror and physical adaptability (such as his famous tar-coated protective trousers). He faces his fated death in Northumbria without a shiver of fear, welcoming Valhalla and his sons' vengeance.",
